onPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4EbgI9pB032JBcvAN85178MtOrt.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2020-09-12\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Living The Dream\",\"overview\":\"F1 has had it all. The greatest cars, the fastest speeds, the technology and the charismatic characters. It's time to look at what has made Formula 1 so special over the past 70 years.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kPtNZqyr1MIQ0Yw07KDoHw9u0Cg.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-12\",\"runtime\":80},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Championship Deciders\",\"overview\":\"Drama. Excitement. Unbelievable tension. Sometimes the championship comes down to the final race after a season-long battle. This episode looks at the championship deciders that have left their mark on the history of Formula 1.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hbKiX1bYzXjW6KmtPhUkzS8W1U0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-19\",\"runtime\":80},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Great Cars of Formula 1\",\"overview\":\"F1 has always been known for pushing boundaries in concepts and design. This episode examines the stories of some of the most successful machines over the past 70 years in F1 by those who were involved.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w58jbXXE37xWcGdSr5jtosNHeBY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-09-26\",\"runtime\":80},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Triumph and Tragedy\",\"overview\":\"Spanning 70 years, F1 has seen some spectacular highs and devastating lows. This episode remembers the drivers who fought back from adversity to triumph - and those who lost their lives doing what they loved.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5Hxcw8mk7XGODGjj6yeohmffqli.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-03\",\"runtime\":80},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Controversial Moments\",\"overview\":\"These are the never-to-be-forgotten incidents in F1. The controversial moments and subsequent fallout that have left their mark in the dramatic history of the sport and still stir debate today.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tJNA1BEDzqJQy4qgjvkdfjqmLFj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-10\",\"runtime\":80},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Great F1 Teams\",\"overview\":\"F1 has always seen periods of domination from teams. This episode looks at who created them, who their champion drivers were and how they became so successful? These are the great F1 teams who will forever be associated with the sport.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hOXenaxdZJ5KQClGwQZnpQ6ZL8x.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-17\",\"runtime\":80},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Trailblazers\",\"overview\":\"The ones who formulated new ways of working and brought success to themselves and those around them, turned dreams into reality, inspired others to follow in their footsteps, the trailblazers who helped shape Formula 1 as we know it today.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6pGHCLvLWcfnz4nlhRpuAr8U5QS.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-10-24\",\"runtime\":80}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-09-12\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}